Fix BSD correctness, rewrite cycle separator, early-termination in separation

- Fixed BSD test: increased tolerance to 0.5 to prevent incorrect edge
  removal (was proving c09 optimal at 708 when true opt is 707)
- Rewrote cycle cut separator with proper Dijkstra-based shortest-cycle
  oracle instead of heuristic neighbor-pair enumeration  
- Added early termination in flow cut separator (stop after 50 violated)
- TF cut separator now only checks top-50 most fractional candidates
- LP heuristic now always runs at root node
- Conditional TF singleton cuts (omit for dense graphs > 4000 arcs)
- LP reduced-cost fixing: attempted but disabled due to HiGHS sign
  convention issues with activation variables present
